Iter Arcanum, an unofficial fan project

Iter Arcanum is an unofficial fan project, heavily inspired by the Mage Knight
board game. It is not affiliated with, endorsed, sponsored or approved by
WizKids, NECA, Czech Games Edition or Vlaada Chvátil. "Mage Knight" is a
trademark of its owner; it is used here only to describe what inspired the game.

The project is free and non-commercial. If you hold rights on anything in this
repository and want it changed or removed, please open an issue: we will act
promptly.


