under permissive licenses compatible with the GPL v3; deny.toml lists the
accepted licenses and `cargo deny check licenses` verifies them. The fonts
embedded by egui are under their own licenses (Ubuntu Font License, SIL Open
Font License, MIT, Apache 2.0).
